<title>JAPAN: Kygnus Sekiyu Seisei '97 topper turnaround plans.</title>
<headline>Kygnus Sekiyu Seisei '97 topper turnaround plans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kygnus Sekiyu Seisei KK said on Friday it planned to close its 70,000 barrel-per-day topper at its Kawasaki refinery in April 1997 for routine maintenance checks.</p>
<p>Kygnus Sekiyu Seisei KK is owned by refiner Tonen Corp.</p>
